    title: "go: the WRITER decides io.WriteString / fmt.Fprint* boundaries (0012's vacuous class): write-side target-kind seam + pipe/net_stream vocabulary + argument stamp -- INV-bagok's network case too"  # 78ee
    status: todo_hard  # 78ee
